imarily electric utility customers in Virginia, North Carolina and South Carolina. At December 31, 2025, Dominion Energy's portfolio of assets includes approximately 30.7 GW of electric generating capacity, 10,800 miles of electric transmission lines and 80,400 miles of electric distribution lines. Dominion Energy is one of the nation's leading developers and operators of regulated offshore wind and solar power and the largest producer of carbon-free electricity in New England. Dominion Energy's mission is to provide the reliable, affordable and increasingly clean energy that powers its customers every day.","zh":"Dominion Energy 總部位於維吉尼亞州里士滿，於 1983 年在維吉尼亞州註冊成立，為維吉尼亞州、北卡羅來納州和南卡羅來納州約 410 萬主要電力公用事業客戶提供服務。截至2025年12月31日，Dominion Energy的資產組合包括約30.7吉瓦的發電量、10,800英里的輸電線路和80,400英里的配電線路。 Dominion Energy 是美國領先的受監管離岸風電和太陽能開發商和營運商之一，也是新英格蘭最大的無碳電力生產商。 Dominion Energy 的使命是提供可靠、實惠且日益清潔的能源，為客戶每天提供電力。"},{"en":"In connection with the comprehensive business review concluded in March 2024, Dominion Energy entered into agreements in September 2023 to sell all of its regulated gas distribution operations, except for DESC's, to Enbridge. In addition, Dominion Energy completed the sale in September 2023 of its remaining 50% noncontrolling partnership interest in Cove Point to BHE under an agreement entered into in July 2023. Dominion Energy continues to focus on expanding and improving its regulated electric utilities and long-term contracted businesses while transitioning to a cleaner energy future. Its approximately $65 billion capital expenditure plan for 2026 through 2030 advances its \"all-of-the-above\" strategy through investments in zero-carbon and renewable generation, grid transformation, generation reliability and transmission and distribution resiliency to meet projected demand growth. Rene","zh":"根據 2024 年 3 月完成的全面業務審查，Dominion Energy 於 2023 年 9 月簽訂協議，將其所有受監管的天然氣分銷業務（DESC 除外）出售給 Enbridge。此外，Dominion Energy 根據 2023 年 7 月簽訂的協議，於 2023 年 9 月完成了將 Cove Point 剩餘 50% 非控制合夥權益出售給 BHE。 Dominion Energy 繼續專注於擴大和改善其受監管的電力公用事業和長期合約業務，同時向清潔能源的未來過渡。其2026年至2030年約650億美元的資本支出計畫透過投資零碳和再生能源發電、電網改造、發電可靠性以及輸電和配電彈性來推進其「上述所有」策略，以滿足預計的需求成長。雷內"},{"en":"Dominion Energy currently expects approximately 95% of earnings to come from state-regulated utility operations in Virginia, North Carolina and South Carolina. Dominion Energy's nonregulated operations consist primarily of long-term contracted electric generation operations. Dominion Energy's operations are conducted through various subsidiaries, including DESC and Virginia Power. DESC is an SEC registrant; however, its Form 10-K is filed separately and is not combined herein.","zh":"Dominion Energy 目前預計約 95% 的收入將來自維吉尼亞州、北卡羅來納州和南卡羅來納州受州監管的公用事業業務。 Dominion Energy 的非監管業務主要包括長期合約發電業務。 Dominion Energy 的營運透過各個子公司進行，包括 DESC 和 Virginia Power。 DESC 是 SEC 註冊人；然而，其表格 10-K 是單獨提交的，並未合併於此。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Dominion Energy incurred $324 million, $314 million and $269 million of expenses (including accretion and depreciation) during 2025, 2024 and 2023 respectively, in connection with environmental protection and monitoring activities. Dominion Energy expects these expenses to be approximately $345 million and $340 million in 2026 and 2027, respectively. In addition, capital expenditures related to environmental controls were $169 million, $216 million and $132 million for 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively. Dominion Energy expects these expenditures to be approximately $140 million and $85 million for 2026 and 2027, respectively.","zh":"Dominion Energy 在 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年期間分別產生了 3.24 億美元、3.14 億美元和 2.69 億美元與環境保護和監測活動相關的費用（包括增值和折舊）。 Dominion Energy 預計 2026 年和 2027 年這些費用分別約為 3.45 億美元和 3.4 億美元。此外，2025年、2024年及2023年與環境控制相關的資本支出分別為1.69億美元、2.16億美元及1.32億美元。 Dominion Energy 預計 2026 年和 2027 年的支出分別約為 1.4 億美元和 8,500 萬美元。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Data centers have been a source of significant increase in demand which is expected to continue over the next decade. The concentration of data centers primarily in Loudoun County, Virginia represents a unique challenge and requires significant investments in electric transmission and generation facilities to meet the growing demand. PJM has projected a 5.4% average peak annual load growth over the next ten years for the PJM DOM Zone, which includes Dominion Energy Virginia's service territory. Data centers represent 28% and 26% of Virginia Power's electricity sales for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. Virginia Power has implemented requirements over the years intended to ensure that its project queue is firm, such as requiring deposits for expensive long lead-time equipment along with reimbursement clauses for canceled projects. In addition, Virginia Power will,","zh":"資料中心一直是需求顯著成長的來源，預計未來十年將持續下去。資料中心主要集中在維吉尼亞州勞登縣，這是一個獨特的挑戰，需要對輸電和發電設施進行大量投資才能滿足不斷增長的需求。 PJM 預計 PJM DOM 區域（包括 Dominion Energy Virginia 的服務區域）未來十年的年平均尖峰負載成長 5.4%。截至2025年12月31日及2024年12月31日止年度，資料中心分別佔維吉尼亞電力售電量的28%及26%。維吉尼亞電力多年來一直實施旨在確保其項目隊列穩定的要求，例如要求昂貴的長交貨期設備的押金以及取消項目的報銷條款。此外，維吉尼亞電力將，"}],"competition":[{"en":"There is no competition for electric distribution service within Virginia Power's service territory in Virginia and North Carolina and no such competition is currently permitted. Historically, since its electric transmission facilities are integrated into PJM and electric transmission services are administered by PJM, there was no competition in relation to transmission service provided to customers within the PJM region. However, competition from non-incumbent PJM transmission owners for development, construction and ownership of certain transmission facilities in Virginia Power's service territory is permitted pursuant to Order 1000, subject to state and local siting and permitting approvals. This has resulted in additional competition to build and own transmission infrastructure in Virginia Power's service area and allows Dominion Energy to seek opportunities to build and own faciliti","zh":"維吉尼亞電力公司在維吉尼亞州和北卡羅來納州的服務區域內不存在配電服務競爭，目前也不允許此類競爭。從歷史上看，由於其輸電設施併入 PJM，且輸電服務由 PJM 管理，因此在向 PJM 地區的客戶提供的輸電服務方面不存在競爭。然而，根據第 1000 號命令，非現任 PJM 輸電所有者可以就弗吉尼亞電力服務區域內某些輸電設施的開發、建設和所有權進行競爭，但須經州和地方選址和許可批准。這導致了在維吉尼亞電力服務區建設和擁有輸電基礎設施的額外競爭，並使 Dominion Energy 能夠尋求建設和擁有設施的機會"},{"en":"Virginia Power's non-jurisdictional solar operations are not currently subject to significant competition as the output from these facilities is primarily sold under long-term power purchase agreements with terms generally ranging from 16 to 25 years. However, in the future, such operations may compete with other power generation facilities to serve certain large-scale customers after the power purchase agreements expire.","zh":""}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Dominion Energy Virginia","val":11840000000,"zh":"維吉尼亞州多米尼恩能源公司"},{"name":"Dominion Energy South Carolina","val":3578000000,"zh":"南卡羅來納州多米尼恩能源公司"},{"name":"Contracted Energy","val":1179000000,"zh":"合約能源"}],"total":16523000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Nonregulated Electricity Sales","val":1239000000,"zh":"不受監管的電力銷售"},{"name":"Other Regulated Revenues","val":309000000,"zh":"其他受監管的收入"},{"name":"Other Nonregulated Revenues","val":266000000,"zh":"其他不受監管的收入"},{"name":"Regulated Gas Transportation & Storage","val":36000000,"zh":"受監管的氣體運輸和儲存"}],"total":16523000000}},"peers":["DUK","SO","AEP","EXC","ED"]}}